Summon an icy spike directly on a foe, impaling it for [153, 205, 246, 281, 312 (TL1-5; SP 100)] cold damage.

At level 5 it hits all foes in range 1 around the target.

Any creature hit will take [10%, 16%, 21%, 26%, 30% (TL1-5)] more damage from your necrotic minions for 3 turns.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
